# Geographic coverage

Canonical file: [`docs/geographic-coverage.md`](../../docs/geographic-coverage.md)

- When adding a CCAA, changing INE province codes, flipping metric status (✅/🚧/❌), or adding a seed scrape alias — **edit that file only**.
- Do **not** copy the coverage matrix into `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, or skills. Link to `docs/geographic-coverage.md` instead.
- Do **not** invent a parallel province/CCAA list elsewhere.
- `README.md` may keep a short seed blurb + link; it must not restate the full table.
- Skill `ine-provinces` must point at `docs/geographic-coverage.md` as the source of truth.
